    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/133d3f3e4d047b4ed7724be67684c9a6.avif?t=1749699846\" width=560 height=94 /></span><strong>LINEAR S is an arcade racing experience where rhythm follows the line.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No detours: Beginner, Advanced, and Expert stages  </strong><br><strong>blend across Arcade, Championship, and Time Attack modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for flow. Choose. Race. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/ff0bff78c2a2666242e5eb9dd1832355.avif?t=1749699846\" width=350 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LINEAR S features a unique hybrid transmission system that combines the intuitive response of an automatic with the control of a manual.</strong><br><br><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each gear is purpose-built:</strong><br><br><strong>First for torque and control, second for smooth driving, third for maximum speed.</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/93ce495732a1017218daebddcb8f5c9c.avif?t=1749699846\" width=768 height=470 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Master the balance between gears and throttle! Every shift affects your grip, acceleration, and trajectory. Feel the car respond to your timing, not just your inputs.</strong> <br>  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/4f939e1bffd399c24fb2b8cc41a9c3f4.avif?t=1749699846\" width=380 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The interface is built to keep you in sync with the car at all times, with visual cues that speak louder than numbers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You always know what\u2019s going on under the hood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</span> \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LINEAR S is being developed under PROJECT S Framework, a specialized Unity-based setup that enables SegaSaturn-accurate rendering through strict standards, custom shaders, and hardware-inspired constraints.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/fd9c344b9e82a21e3bfa73cdb7217db3.avif?t=1749699846\" width=639 height=306 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sega Saturn Control Pad as the target layout</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>320x224 internal resolution</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2000 quads per frame cap</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per-mesh transparency simulation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anamorphic widescreen support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 FPS target (with optional 60 FPS)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quad-based rendering</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/133d3f3e4d047b4ed7724be67684c9a6.avif?t=1749699846\" width=560 height=94 /></span><strong>LINEAR S is an arcade racing experience where rhythm follows the line.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No detours: Beginner, Advanced, and Expert stages  </strong><br><strong>blend across Arcade, Championship, and Time Attack modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for flow. Choose. Race. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/ff0bff78c2a2666242e5eb9dd1832355.avif?t=1749699846\" width=350 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LINEAR S features a unique hybrid transmission system that combines the intuitive response of an automatic with the control of a manual.</strong><br><br><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each gear is purpose-built:</strong><br><br><strong>First for torque and control, second for smooth driving, third for maximum speed.</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383270/extras/93ce495732a1017218daebddcb8f5c9c.avif?t=1749699846\" width=768